  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for libmikmod",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libmikmod fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in libmikmod:\n\n- CVE-2026-105839: make sure that numtrk calculation fits into an UWORD (bsc#1284366)\n- CVE-2026-105838: bump itpat allocation to 256, matching allowed packlen limit (bsc#1284367)\n- CVE-2026-105837: make sure that numtrk calculation fits into an UWORD (bsc#1284368)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
